# Agentic workflow

- Read `specs/ACTIVE.md` before implementing; if not `(none)`, follow that SPEC.
- Prefer `npm run agent:verify` over ad-hoc partial checks before claiming done.
- End non-trivial sessions: update `memory-bank/activeContext.md` and `progress.md`.
- Ralph: one PLAN task per session — see `docs/agentic-development/ralph-loop.md`.
- Do not edit `scripts/agent-verify.mjs` or rename `lib/analytics-events.ts` during experiments.
